Dolby Atmos UI
==============

A Jetpack Compose front-end for the Dolby Atmos DAX3 effect. The package stays
`co.aospa.dolby`, so Settings injection, the Quick Settings tile, the summary
provider and existing preference files keep working.

Screens
-------

* **Home** – master switch, profile chips, quick toggles (bass, volume leveler,
  dialogue, virtualizer), an equalizer preview and a shortcut to the advanced
  settings.
* **Equalizer** – draggable 10-band graphic equalizer (backed by the 20 DAP
  bands), built-in presets and user preset management (save, rename, delete).
* **Advanced** – immersion (speaker/headphone virtualizer, stereo widening),
  clarity (intelligent EQ, dialogue enhancer), bass/mid/treble tuning curves and
  dynamics (volume leveler), plus a per-profile reset.

How to use
----------

1. Clone this repo to `packages/apps/DolbyUI`.

2. Add the package to your device makefile:

```
## Dolby
PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
    DolbyAtmos
```

The app is platform-signed, privileged and installed on `system_ext`.
